  "stem_markdown": "### 9. 下列求导数运算中不正确的是（）\n\nA. $(4)' = 2$\n\nB. $(\\ln x)' = \\frac{1}{x \\ln 10}$\n\nC. $(3^{x})' = x \\cdot 3^{x-1}$\n\nD. $(x^{5})' = 5x^{4}$",
